their own iconic attacks and skills. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Outfit each team with hundreds of weapons and spells, from simple blades and missiles to ancient, eldritch artifacts that produce world-ending magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Defeat doesn’t mean permadeath, but there is a price to pay: Every time a warrior falls, it means a grave wound, a stat penalty, and weakening your squad.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374840/extras/d7293cc0631495e2bf186af7f98f66e5.avif?t=1781725571\" width=780 height=170 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374840/extras/f3e8d2e2305145629a71e23cf27a8353.poster.avif?t=1781725571\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374840/extras/f3e8d2e2305145629a71e23cf27a8353.webm?t=1781725571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374840/extras/f3e8d2e2305145629a71e23cf27a8353.mp4?t=1781725571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Hope is a rare commodity in a world ruined by Calamity, good thing these heroes are filled to the brim.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defy the fates and make a difference as the head of this unlikely band of heroes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch characters bond together on the battlefield and their relationships evolve through 400 individual conversations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember: Any hero can make a difference - if they live long enough.</p></li></ul>",
